            (("Notebook 01 が PARTICIPANT_ID で停止する", "Notebook 01 stops on PARTICIPANT_ID"),
             ("001〜999 の3桁の文字列か確認します（000、空欄、4桁以上は使えません）。", "Check that it is a three-digit string from 001 to 999 (000, an empty value and four or more digits are not allowed).")),
            (("Notebook 02〜04 が、実行前の確認で停止する", "Notebooks 02–04 stop at the checks before running"),
             ("ENVIRONMENT（dev・test・prod）、SCOPE_FILE、PRIVATE_EVIDENCE_DIR（実行記録の保存先）、EXPECTED_WORKSPACE_NAME（正確な表示名）が設定されているかを確認します。Notebook が、範囲のファイルに書かれたフォルダーにあるかも確認します。書き込みを伴う段階では、APPLY_CHANGES、CONFIRMED_PLAN_SHA256、WRITE_GATE_FILE（承認のファイル）も必要です。", "Check that ENVIRONMENT (dev, test or prod), SCOPE_FILE, PRIVATE_EVIDENCE_DIR (the run-record folder) and EXPECTED_WORKSPACE_NAME (the exact display name) are set. Also check that the Notebook is in the folder named in the scope file. Stages that write also need APPLY_CHANGES, CONFIRMED_PLAN_SHA256 and WRITE_GATE_FILE (the approval file).")),
